    "description": "Objective\n\nKeep the Sign-Up's Recent Click Timestamp in sync with the most recent related Study Link Click.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Populate Sign_Up__c.Recent Click Timestamp from the latest related Study Link Click record\n\n* Recalculate when a new click lands against the Sign-Up\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* A newer click updates the field; an older backdated click does not\n\nDependencies\n\nBUILD-13 (field), POC-09 (Study Link Click object — complete).\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nThe source doc says \"rollup\", but Study_Link_Click\\__c.Related_Sign_Up_\\_c is a LOOKUP, not master-detail — so a true roll-up summary is not available. This will almost certainly be a flow. Confirm before estimating.\n\nEstimate: S · \\~4h\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 6.",
